This package contains no third-party code. It depends on packages that npm
installs separately, each under its own licence, among them
@xenova/transformers (Apache License 2.0).

At run time, the default embedder (Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2) and the optional
cross-encoder reranker (Xenova/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2) load pretrained models
from the Hugging Face Hub. Each model is published under its own licence.
